Important HTTP Status Codes:

Success:
200 → OK (GET)
201 → Created (Resource, POST)
204 → No Content (Successfully deleted , DELETE)

Invalid Client Request:
400 → Bad Request (Configured from the client side)
401 → Unauthorized (Doesn't hv permission for the application itself)
403 → Forbidden (Authorised but not allowed to use the resource)
404 → Not Found (Resource)
409 → Conflict
422 → Validation/semantic error
429 → Too Many Requests

Server Errors:
500 → Internal Server Error (means something unexpected happened on the server.)
                        (Ex:NullPointerException, Database failure ,Unexpected application error)
502 → Bad Gateway
503 → Service Unavailable
504 → Gateway Timeout